sequenceDiagram
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Manager as ContextManager
  participant Store as SupabaseContextStore
  participant Retrieval as Hybrid retrieval
  participant Budget as Context budget/compiler
  participant Model as Local Qwen
  API->>Manager: verified user + message + subject/language
  Manager->>Store: caller-scoped memory/messages/chunks/artifacts
  Store-->>Manager: RLS-filtered records
  Manager->>Retrieval: sparse+dense candidates and optional web
  Retrieval-->>Budget: ranked, deduplicated context items
  Budget-->>API: bounded source-labelled prompt
  API->>Model: OpenAI-compatible completion
  Model-->>API: answer/model metadata
  API->>Manager: process memory and summaries
